== S0: before publishing, ensure reports unpublished records

$ fm-office.sh ensure
OFFICE: office navigator: authority record is unproven (inheritance receipt is missing or unsafe); run bin/fm-office.sh publish navigator
OFFICE: office quartermaster: authority record is unproven (inheritance receipt is missing or unsafe); run bin/fm-office.sh publish quartermaster
[exit 0]
