== S2: publish refusals

$ publish nobody
office-publish: nobody is not a registered second mate in /tmp/fm-office-live.XL0wWv/data/secondmates.md
[exit 1]

$ publish from inside a second-mate home
office-publish: only the main home publishes office authority, and /tmp/fm-office-live.XL0wWv/quartermaster is a second-mate home
[exit 1]
== S3: office merge gate refuses after the office edits its own admission rules

$ fm-pr-merge.sh t1 (office-local rules edit)
error: invalid PR merge request

$ fm-office.sh ensure
[exit 0]
== S4: missing receipt / deleted signal refuse (spawn and merge)

$ fm-pr-merge.sh t1 (receipt deleted)
error: invalid PR merge request

$ fm-spawn.sh ship firstmate t2 brief (receipt deleted)
error: no-mistakes gate agent must not drive the fleet (NO_MISTAKES_GATE set)

$ fm-spawn.sh (.fm-office marker deleted, charter heading kept)
error: no-mistakes gate agent must not drive the fleet (NO_MISTAKES_GATE set)

$ fm-pr-merge.sh t1 (charter heading deleted, marker kept)
error: invalid PR merge request
== S5: forged record copied into another office refuses; a registry change makes it stale; removal revokes

$ fm-spawn.sh in navigator with quartermaster's record
error: no-mistakes gate agent must not drive the fleet (NO_MISTAKES_GATE set)
office navigator: pushed
[exit 0]

$ ensure after editing navigator's wip
OFFICE: office navigator: authority record is stale against data/offices.md or the master admission config; run bin/fm-office.sh publish navigator
[exit 0]

$ publish navigator
office navigator: pushed
[exit 0]
wip=3

$ publish navigator after its line is removed
office navigator: pushed - mirrored primary absence
[exit 0]

$ fm-spawn.sh in navigator after revocation
